text.en:
Compute the feedback before shifting and gate the polynomial XOR on `fb`.
```vhdl
fb := r(7) xor din;
shifted := r(6 downto 0) & '0';
if fb = '1' then r <= shifted xor POLY;
else            r <= shifted; end if;
```

text.es:
Calcula la realimentación antes de desplazar y condiciona el XOR del polinomio a `fb`.
```vhdl
fb := r(7) xor din;
shifted := r(6 downto 0) & '0';
if fb = '1' then r <= shifted xor POLY;
else            r <= shifted; end if;
```
